{
    "name": "§dChloe Price",
    "entityType": "easy_npc:humanoid",
    "description": "Max's rebellious and loyal best friend.",
    "skin": {
        "type": "CUSTOM",
        "textureId": "Chloe_Price_a57d0e00"
    },
    "attributes": {
        "maxHealth": 40,
        "invulnerable": false,
        "attackableByPlayers": true,
        "attackableByMonsters": true,
        "nameVisibility": "NEVER"
    },
    "dialogs": {
        "main": {
            "greeting": "嘿，新面孔。你是哪个班的？别担心，我不是来找麻烦的... 除非你惹我。我是克洛伊，克洛伊·普莱斯。你最好记住这个名字。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "§6§l接受任务",
                    "action": "OPEN_QUEST_DIALOG:RANDOM_POOL:e754a681-ba3c-4586-ad62-c2d17ff2a72e,e6e017aa-42b1-467b-80f2-7f98e0617e6b,627b9fe7-50e2-472f-9ff0-2a658d4dddc7,4bd4923e-0133-4827-8ac9-e6dcfcebe051,be0f3b1a-dcff-49c3-a141-ac4be8f6adfb",
                    "id": "btn_quest_590bc868"
                },
                {
                    "label": "你看起来很不爽",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:talk_anger",
                    "id": "btn_1"
                },
                {
                    "label": "你和麦克斯是朋友？",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:talk_max",
                    "id": "btn_2"
                },
                {
                    "label": "这所学校怎么样？",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:talk_school",
                    "id": "btn_3"
                },
                {
                    "label": "我在调查一些事...",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:quest_intro",
                    "id": "btn_quest"
                }
            ]
        },
        "talk_anger": {
            "greeting": "不爽？我当然不爽。被困在这个无聊透顶的讲座里，听着那些有钱的混蛋吹嘘他们的‘艺术’。要不是为了... 算了，你不会懂的。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "为了什么？",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:why_here",
                    "id": "btn_why"
                },
                {
                    "label": "我懂你的感受",
                    "action": "CLOSE_DIALOG",
                    "id": "btn_close"
                },
                {
                    "label": "回到刚才的话题",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:main",
                    "id": "btn_back"
                }
            ]
        },
        "why_here": {
            "greeting": "为了找点乐子，行了吧？或者是为了找机会给那些自以为是的家伙找点不痛快。这里太压抑了，我需要发泄一下。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "别惹大麻烦",
                    "action": "CLOSE_DIALOG",
                    "id": "btn_close"
                },
                {
                    "label": "回到刚才的话题",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:main",
                    "id": "btn_back"
                }
            ]
        },
        "talk_max": {
            "greeting": "麦克斯？你是说麦克斯·考菲尔德？那个总是躲在相机后面的小不点。哈，我们好久没见了。她变了，变得... 沉默寡言。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "她好像很在意你",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:max_cares",
                    "id": "btn_cares"
                },
                {
                    "label": "你们之间发生了什么？",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:main",
                    "id": "btn_back"
                }
            ]
        },
        "max_cares": {
            "greeting": "是吗？也许吧。她总是那样，想帮忙又不敢说。有时候真想撬开她的脑袋看看里面装了什么。不过... 如果她需要我，我会在的。一直都是。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "这很感人",
                    "action": "CLOSE_DIALOG",
                    "id": "btn_close"
                },
                {
                    "label": "回到刚才的话题",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:main",
                    "id": "btn_back"
                }
            ]
        },
        "talk_school": {
            "greeting": "黑木学院？表面上光鲜亮丽，实际上烂透了。充满了虚伪的精英和被宠坏的熊孩子。如果你不是其中之一，那你最好小心点。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "听起来你很了解",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:school_details",
                    "id": "btn_details"
                },
                {
                    "label": "我会小心的",
                    "action": "CLOSE_DIALOG",
                    "id": "btn_close"
                }
            ]
        },
        "school_details": {
            "greeting": "我见过太多事了。那些有钱的少爷小姐们以为自己能摆平一切。但真相总会浮出水面的，对吧？我就是来找真相的。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "什么真相？",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:quest_intro",
                    "id": "btn_quest"
                },
                {
                    "label": "回到刚才的话题",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:main",
                    "id": "btn_back"
                }
            ]
        },
        "quest_intro": {
            "greeting": "我在找一个人。瑞秋·安珀。她是这所学校的女王，但她失踪了。警察说她离家出走，但我不信。这里的人在撒谎，我知道。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "我能帮你找吗？",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:quest_accept",
                    "id": "btn_next"
                },
                {
                    "label": "这听起来很危险",
                    "action": "CLOSE_DIALOG",
                    "id": "btn_cancel"
                }
            ]
        },
        "quest_accept": {
            "greeting": "真的？你愿意帮忙？太好了。我需要有人帮我盯着那些混蛋，特别是内森·普雷斯科特那个疯子。我要把这该死的学校翻个底朝天。",
            "buttons": [
                {
                    "label": "成交（接受任务）",
                    "action": "CLOSE_DIALOG",
                    "id": "btn_acc"
                },
                {
                    "label": "我再考虑一下",
                    "action": "SHOW_DIALOG:main",
                    "id": "btn_back"
                }
            ]
        }
    },
    "pose": "STANDING",
